Template: odroid-player/installed
Type: note
Description: Successfully installed odroid-player!
 You can play the videos using 'odroid-player' command.
 This packags contains various type of client samples to control the player:
  - odroid-player-client      : Simple CUI client
  - odroid-player-client-web  : Web interface client
  - odroid-player-client-ir   : Ir interface client
  - odroid-player-client-oled : Show media stream information on I2C display.
 Some client samples require to load the proper kernel modules and dts overlays.
 Please check the Hardkernel Wiki for further information, and have fun with 
 ODROID!

